\ A protocol-bounded call site in an interpreter-free AOT binary names
\ itself by its protocol in trace output. Trace emission is Zig runtime
\ code with no interpreter involvement, so it works under the locked
\ interpreter-free build; the lock applies to the fallback knob only,
\ not the ONEZ_TRACE_WORDS env var set in the .env sidecar.
\
\ The trace event fires at helper entry, before the satisfies-check, so
\ the unregistered-fixnum operand still produces the event and then the
\ protocol error.

addable: protocol{ bump-it: } ;
bump-it: generic ( x: addable -- n ) [ drop 0 ] ;

\ Protocol-bounded call site: compiled output emits aotSatisfiesAndDispatch.
bounded-caller: ( x: addable -- n ) [ bump-it ] ;

1 bounded-caller drop
